            0.109
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ How many square tiles are there in each figure?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.123,
            0.814,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How many are there in Step 4 of the sequence? What about Step 10?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.159,
            0.801,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Write an algebraic expression for the number of tiles in Step n. Share your methods with the class. Can you find more than one method to arrive at the answer?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
            0.154,
            0.904,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.817,
                0.154,
                0.904,
                0.207
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_17_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.232,
            0.846,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Find the area of the (interior) shaded region in the figure below. All four rectangles have the same dimensions. m"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.276,
            0.339,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Tadang’s method:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.294,
            0.704,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The total region is a square of side (m + n) with an area "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( m + n ) ^ { 2 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.331,
            0.704,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Subtracting the area of four rectangles from the total area will give the area of the interior shaded region. That is, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( m + n ) ^ { 2 } - 4 m n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.393,
            0.324,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Yusuf’s method:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.716,
            0.255,
            0.921,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.716,
                0.255,
                0.921,
                0.413
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_17_image_11.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.412,
            0.705,
            0.449
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The shaded region is a square with sidelength (n – m). So, its area is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( n - m ) ^ { 2 } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.458,
            0.465,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "By expanding both expressions,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.484,
            0.49,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "check that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(m + n)^{2} - 4mn = (n - m)^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.519,
            0.72,
            0.577
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Find out the area of the region with slanting lines in the figure. All three rectangles have the same dimensions (Fig. 1)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
